  "description_short": "Contemporary café on Plettenberg Bay's main street serving excellent coffee and wholesome, fresh meals.",
  "description_long": "Tucked along Main Street in the heart of Plettenberg Bay, Cafe Civara has earned a loyal following for its consistently good coffee and thoughtfully prepared food. The menu leans towards fresh, wholesome ingredients with options that cater to various dietary preferences, making it an easy choice whether you're after a leisurely breakfast, quick lunch, or afternoon pick-me-up.\n\nThe atmosphere strikes a comfortable balance between relaxed and contemporary, with friendly service that keeps regulars coming back. It's the kind of place where you can settle in with a laptop or catch up with friends over a proper flat white. The central location makes it convenient for a break while exploring Plett's shops and galleries, and the quality speaks for itself in the consistently high ratings from both locals and visitors.",
